page is still the one you reviewed.

8
00:00:25.838 --> 00:00:27.978
With the emergency accounts proven,

9
00:00:27.978 --> 00:00:31.975
Chapter 3 can safely build
Conditional Access for administrators.

10
00:00:31.975 --> 00:00:33.140
Thanks for watching.
